     "content_html": "The ordered pairs of the relation are: <span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\left( {-3,\\,3} \\right),\\left( {-2,\\,2} \\right),\\left( {-1,\\,0} \\right),\\left( {0,\\,-1} \\right),\\left( {2,\\,-2} \\right),\\left( {4,\\,-4} \\right)} \\right\\}\">\\left\\{ {\\left( {-3,3} \\right),\\left( {-2,2} \\right),\\left( {-1,0} \\right),\\left( {0,-1} \\right),\\left( {2,-2} \\right),\\left( {4,-4} \\right)} \\right\\}</span>."
    }
